<section class="sec"><div class="wrap sv-grid"><article class="prose"><p>Prestige Tree And Landscape is the arborist residents and businesses in Draper depend on. We offer impeccable expertise, licensed services, and unrivaled tree care knowledge. We go above and beyond to meet your high expectations because we understand how important keeping your trees healthy and looking their best is to you.</p>
<p>When you need a specialist with abundant experience covering many tree species, don&#x27;t accept anything less than the quality and professionalism you deserve. The depth of our knowledge encompasses trimming, pruning, diagnostics, and care that prevents your beloved trees from experiencing ill health and ensures they&#x27;re the perfect height and shape to suit your taste.</p>
<p>Dial 801.859.9786 to make an appointment to consult with us at no obligation.</p>
<p>Contact Us</p>
<h2>Certified Arborist</h2>
<p>Do you have questions about your favorite trees&#x27; health and well-being that only a certified arborist can answer? Perhaps you&#x27;d like to remodel your yard, and you are looking to relocate a special tree with the utmost care. Better still, you may want to reduce the size and girth of the canopy of mature trees to produce a better view and a tidier appearance. Whatever the case may be, we are confident in our ability to align our wide range of services with your needs precisely.</p>
<p>Connect with us to discuss the specifics of your trees with a licensed professional with plenty of experience and a passion for keeping saplings and fully grown trees in the best condition.</p>
<h2>We Accurately Diagnose Diseased or Dying Trees</h2>
<p>Identifying when trees on your property are diseased or at risk of fall damage is no easy task. Some trees can look like they’re on the verge of falling but manage to heal themselves, while others may seem completely healthy but are internally cracked and decaying. That’s why working with a certified arborist like Prestige Tree And Landscape is essential.</p>
<p>No one wants to remove trees from their property unnecessarily, nor would anyone voluntarily leave a tree that puts their property at risk of damage. When you hire our arborists, you won’t have to worry about identifying or removing diseased trees—our experts will handle it for you.</p>
<p>Our professionally trained technicians have the skills and expertise to efficiently flag and remove trees in danger of falling. Hiring our dependable arborists for regularly scheduled inspections is a sure way to keep your property safe from falling trees.</p>
<h2>Comprehensive Arborist Services</h2>
<p>At Prestige Tree And Landscape, we have the requisite training and professional equipment to safely manage tree planting, repairs, and removals. We proudly offer a comprehensive range of tree services to residential and commercial clients throughout Draper and have a long track record of exceptional work. Our arborists undergo extensive training and have the ability to evaluate the health of your trees and make recommendations to keep your property as safe as possible.</p>
<p>Whether you need inspections, environmental assessments, tree removal, or even pruning services, our team has you covered. We’ve developed a streamlined process to help guarantee the quality and efficiency of our service, and we’re confident we’re the right choice for your tree needs.</p>
<p>When you hire us, you can expect to receive the following:</p>
<ul><li>Zero-obligation consultations</li><li>Honest price estimates</li><li>Efficient project turnarounds</li><li>Thorough safety inspections</li><li>Work completed safely</li><li>Long-lasting tree repairs/relocation</li><li>Communicative customer service</li><li>…and more!</li></ul>
<h2>Reliable Tree Inspections</h2>
<p>As certified arborists, one of our most essential tasks involves assessing the health, age, and overall status of trees. Rather than removing trees at the first sign of a problem, our technicians take a more measured approach and work tirelessly to identify the nature and cause of the issue. Some diseased trees are beyond saving, but many trees with trunk or branch damage can be repaired or saved through various measures.</p>
<p>When you hire our team, you can rest assured that you’ll receive honest, reliable information about the status of the trees on your property. Our team will make recommendations that have your best interests at heart, and we’ll stand by our decisions. We’re one of Draper’s top arborists, and we’ve worked hard to earn that reputation. Our technicians will do everything possible to help your property, and we’re confident we can satisfy your needs.</p>
<h2>Efficient Turnarounds on Tree Services</h2>
<p>A damaged or overgrown tree on your lot can be an eyesore and even pose a risk to your property and person. That’s why the arborists at Prestige Tree And Landscape work hard to efficiently complete their assessments, repairs, and relocation services. We appreciate the need for prompt service and do everything possible to minimize our service times and maximize our effectiveness.</p>
<h2>Safe and Reliable Arbor Tree-Service</h2>
<p>As licensed and insured professionals with a multitude of experience tucked into our belts, we&#x27;re proud to say we go the extra mile to ensure each arbor tree service we provide is tailored to your exact preferences and specifications.</p>
<p>We are also committed to ensuring the safety of each worksite we attend is well monitored and that there is no accidental injury or damage to anyone in the vicinity or to your property.</p>
<p>Some of our most frequently requested services include:</p>
<ul><li>Tree maintenance and inspections</li><li>Cabling</li><li>Fertilization</li><li>Pruning</li><li>Tree repairs</li><li>Tree planting, replacement, relocation, and removal</li><li>Tree protection</li><li>Tree diagnostics and disease intervention</li></ul>
<h2>When to Call a Tree Doctor</h2>
<p>If your trees and other woody plantings have been affected by bad weather, you&#x27;ll know you need a tree doctor right away. However, it&#x27;s important to note there are many more ways we can contribute to the success and increased value of your landscape.</p>
<p>Our experts recommend getting in touch with a tree doctor when:</p>
<ul><li>Your trees are showing signs of damage or change that you&#x27;ve not noticed before</li><li>The tree is starting to lean</li><li>You&#x27;d like the canopy of the tree to be reduced</li><li>Branches need pruning</li><li>Insects have taken over</li><li>Part of a tree is broken, and careful repair work could save the limb</li><li>You&#x27;d like to move a tree that is encroaching on your home or another space you&#x27;d like to use</li><li>The tree requires cabling</li><li>You&#x27;d like to change the shape or height of a tree</li><li>You&#x27;re planting trees and would like assistance with selection, placement, and installation for the best results</li></ul>
<p>Our services extend far beyond what is listed above. If you have questions about an existing tree or one you&#x27;d like to add to your property in the future, don&#x27;t hesitate to reach out.</p>
<h2>The Trusted Local Arborist</h2>
<p>Prestige Tree And Landscape is proud to be a name people trust with their trees and landscape. If you need any work done on your property, we recommend leaving the job with our professional arborists. We provide all of the services you need to maintain beautiful trees, which allows you to take the guesswork out of your tree health by contacting our local experts.</p>
<h2>Award Winning Tree Services</h2>
<p>We have been working in the tree care industry for several decades now, and we have been honored to receive numerous awards recognizing our top-notch service. If you need any more convincing that we are the right choice for all of your tree care needs, then we encourage you to check out some of the recognition we have received over the years.</p>
<h2>Why You Need a Certified Arborist</h2>
<p>While many services can claim to be tree specialists, only certified arborists can provide you with authoritative tree care. Here at Prestige Tree And Landscape, our team has all of the training, experience, and certifications they need to treat your trees right.</p>
<p>Here are some of the reasons that you should consider our certified crew for your next job:</p>
<ul><li>Extensive knowledge and experience</li><li>Reduces your liability</li><li>Qualified to provide tree removal</li><li>Professional tools and equipment</li><li>Best safety practices</li><li>Accurate diagnosis of tree diseases and other problems</li></ul>
<p>We are confident that you will not regret your decision to hire our licensed arborists, so keep us in mind next time you need help with your trees.</p>
<h2>Quick Response Times on Tree Emergencies</h2>
<p>Sometimes you don’t have the luxury of waiting for the help you need—but our qualified arborists will always be happy to help. If you have an emergency involving your trees, you can rest assured that we will respond immediately and help you resolve the issue as swiftly as possible. Damaged or diseased trees can threaten your property, so call us at any sign of danger to avoid larger issues.</p>
<h2>Great Rates on Arborist Services</h2>
<p>You don’t need to empty out your pockets in order to take advantage of our certified arborist services. We proudly provide our industry-leading tree services at some of the best prices around, so you can get the help you need without exceeding your budget. We would be happy to tell you more about our rates and the services we offer, so feel free to get in touch with us when you are ready to learn more.</p>
<h2>Shed Some Light on Your Tree Care Needs</h2>
<p>Without the proper training and experience, taking care of trees can be confusing. If you would like to take the uncertainty out of the process and avoid making mistakes with your property, then we encourage you to work with our team of certified arborists. Not only can we provide you with professional tree care, but we will also take the time to answer your questions that you have and provide you with tips for looking after your trees and landscape.</p>
<h2>Hire a Reputable Tree-Service Company</h2>
<p>Prestige Tree And Landscape is the prompt, professional tree-service company the people of Draper trust to get the job done right.</p>
